# Score B: notes copied from the English Wikipedia page at its URL, under CC BY-SA 4.0; the page is the attribution. Retrieved 2026-11-07, used only to compare, never served.
# Verse 1 and chorus. Verse: upper voice; chorus: top note of the right-hand chords.
# Published 1881 by Charles E. Pratt (1841-1902) under the pseudonyms H. J. Fulmer / J. T. Wood; Wikipedia calls the song traditional. Filed as traditional.
id my-bonnie
de My Bonnie
en My Bonnie Lies over the Ocean
aliases my bonnie is over the ocean;bring back my bonnie to me;my bonny lies over the ocean
