settled Matthias 2026-11-07: bars 1, 5 and 9 ("Bonnie lies"), A (Wier 1915) has E5:6 D5:2 C5:4 (dotted), B (en.wikipedia, moved +5) E5:4 D5:4 C5:4 (even); bar 20 ("back"), A C5:12, B D5:12; bar 28 ("back, Oh,"), A D5:8 C5:4, B D5:12; and the end, A's last note C5:12~ C5:4 R:4 (20, closing against the pickup), B C5:24, so B is 4 sixteenths longer; Zitro plays the old print's version (Wier 1915), and crops of A's scan confirmed A.
